#: scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c2ebefa46b331065a354ee5f1052b329b4f85ff853938620bc5c360e5562fde
#. default-sha256: a3ab847b3fd1ef60da8d8901b60772ca40f96a88cbf3ec9e89db36afb05b133b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Without exception, everyone who had wandered into the mansion "
"had lost their lives before the sun rose the next morning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Senza alcuna eccezione, tutti coloro che erano entrati nella "
"villa avevano perso la vita prima che il sole sorgesse il mattino seguente."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 385412e03d9a97ac1ce5bc87f76fe4f7651d2b82f74dec6b6b52caf608e2cb6d
#. default-sha256: d1a97134d96fc726bfff8776a1eb5b44df53627b46294cd28bbaafc3ad5597f1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was the first visitor who had not met this fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lei fu il primo visitatore a non aver incontrato tale destino."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed797292428d910c1f7f66d1a5a863bb0931dfeb067d686f959d42f18b1d251f
#. default-sha256: 9e4fbbcf14e400064cad903b686c9c161b1188139f41621e5ddbd06a531ca125
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, Bestia’s madness gradually subsided; ⟪k:1⟫he even began to seem rather tame. ⟪k:2⟫"
"You would hardly believe it was the same beast who had once reveled in those perverse festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Col passare del tempo, la follia di Bestia si placò gradualmente; ⟪k:1⟫cominciò a sembrare "
"anche piuttosto mansueto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Era impensabile che fosse la stessa bestia che fino a poco "
"tempo prima si godeva quelle feste perverse."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7f4e2f24613d69672fce8d9ae79efb6fb8092dcf34e247b1cac67777cec2dba
#. default-sha256: e36769c441d4befd8ea975b286d7084fae82f1031f7248b03628b5650db66fad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was, I imagine, at a loss for how to behave."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Suppongo non sapesse come comportarsi."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28785f3faba9ee3c2aab2bd9a2bb8ec971e647052faa191bbb6ec666b5842a0d
#. default-sha256: 3db1600f667623c52e99ba5066fcc9b0ce256333cc601fcb09417dbff1076f03
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I too would be flustered in the constant presence of such beauty."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Anch’io sarei disorientata dalla costante presenza di una tale bellezza."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17ce2f72eb47978370d8fc56327163cc7a6f6350eb64cc4121f293df0cf9141e
#. default-sha256: 62372f4454642a6d302efdf867978934fb5a238c9fe2d75739b67c220840e868
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not just her appearance; ⟪k:1⟫she had said she wished to live with him—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"a beast who had committed countless atrocities. ⟪k:4⟫Perplexing indeed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non era solo per il suo aspetto; ⟪k:1⟫aveva detto che desiderava vivere con lui—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"con una bestia che aveva commesso innumerevoli atrocità. ⟪k:4⟫Sconcertante, non trova?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B50B9D3C_4359_45FB_A6A0_304B59FEF526
