msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I said... ⟪k:1⟫that I had no need for peace, yet here I am...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Avevo detto... ⟪k:1⟫di non aver bisogno della pace, eppure eccomi qui...)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8994C00C_0D88_487E_804B_8DE5B11C8C54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
